  "_meta": {
    "source": "romm-dock maintained (in-tree, not vendored) — standalone PCSX2 BIOS dumps, which the emu-atlas/libretro-derived bios_registry.json does not list",
    "emulator": "pcsx2",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "notes": "PCSX2 needs one BIOS; only the USA v2.00 dump EmuDeck's PCSX2 is set to is required, every other region and revision is optional. md5 is used for content-based identification, so a renamed dump still resolves. firmware_path sits under pcsx2/bios/, flattened into the BIOS root on Windows. See docs/user-guide/bios-management.md#playstation-2-standalone-pcsx2."
  },
